WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.477
In the case expression version, the query groups admissions by month.

00:00:04.477 --> 00:00:11.842
For each diagnosis column, the case expression checks whether the current row belongs to that diagnosis.

00:00:11.842 --> 00:00:15.402
If it matches, the row contributes a value.

00:00:15.402 --> 00:00:21.672
If it does not match, it contributes zero or nothing, depending on the expression.

00:00:21.672 --> 00:00:26.591
The aggregate then combines those contributions into the final monthly count.
